# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_room1_events.rpy:339
translate schinese ep10_dad_phone_call_label_12652c3e:

    # dad "Morning, Son."
    dad "早上好，小子。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_room1_events.rpy:341
translate schinese ep10_dad_phone_call_label_8d94cf7c:

    # mc "Morning. Is this a good time?"
    mc "早上好。现在方便说话吗？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_room1_events.rpy:343
translate schinese ep10_dad_phone_call_label_e40e3cb9:

    # dad "Yes, I can talk. How was your weekend and that big party of yours?"
    dad "嗯，我有空。你周末过得怎么样？那场大聚会怎么样？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_room1_events.rpy:348
translate schinese ep10_dad_phone_call_label_b80e83b8:

    # mc "The party was great, mostly. The place was packed, and we had a blast."
    mc "派对整体很棒。那里挤满了人，我们玩得特别尽兴。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_room1_events.rpy:353
translate schinese ep10_dad_phone_call_label_0f66e9c7:

    # dad "That's nice. Did everything go according to plan?"
    dad "那不错啊。一切按计划进行的？"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_room1_events.rpy:358
translate schinese ep10_dad_phone_call_label_8bf44da7:

    # mc "More or less. There were a couple of incidents. Nothing major."
    mc "差不多吧。出了几件事。不过都不是什么大问题。"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_room1_events.rpy:359
translate schinese ep10_dad_phone_call_label_2627efd8:

    # mc "Oh, I wanted to ask you something. I know you're not an electrician, but since you know things and people..."
    mc "哦，我想问你个事。我知道你不是电工，但因为你了解情况和人……"

# freeroam\episode10\ep10_freeroam_room1_events.rpy:360
translate schinese ep10_dad_phone_call_label_7892c5e4:

    # mc "Our power went out during the party, and we don't know what caused it."
